    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Watch Us Shine",
      "National Airlines\npresents\nWatch Us Shine\nSide A Stereo\nDPL1-0278-A\nTHEN NOR NOOR ADE IN U.S.A\n2010.025",
      "Special Products\nNational Airlines\npresents\nWatch Us Shine\nSide B Stereo\nDPL 1-0278-B\n1 Way Down Yonder in New Orleans-\nJimmy McPartland and His Dixielanders\nNm\nin Paris-Rosemary Clooney\nSerenade -Morton Gould and\n° by Chat at ranged and onlin gary.\nTWO RA COME IN USA",
      "Watch Us Shine",
      "National Airlines presents\n\"Watch Us Shine\"\nA series of songs about National destinations,\nand the National spirit of sunshine.\nSide 1\nWatch Us Shine\nHere Comes the Sun\nSong From \"Moulin Rouge\"\nA Foggy Day\nDo You Know The Way to\nSan Jose\nLos Angeles\nLet The Sunshine In\nSide 2\nWay Down Yonder In\nNew Orleans\nApril In Paris\nManhattan Serenade\nHouston\nMiami Beach Rhumba\n#Left My Heart In\nSan Francisco\nWatch Us Shine\nArranged and Conducted by\nCharles Calello\nHugo Montenegro Orchestra and Chorus\nMelachrino Strings\nPaul Anka\nFloyd Cramer\nMoe willas\nOriginal Cast \"Hair\"\nJimmy McPartland\nRosemary Clooney\nMorton Gould\nBobby Bare\nTito Puente\nJohn Gary\nArranged and Conducted by Charles Calello\n\"Watch Us Shine\"\nSure as the sun keeps risin\nWe keep on risin' too\nTo meet the challenge of your day\nAnd warm the way for you\nWe give you the feel of sunshine\nOur own special kind\nWe're National, the Sunshine Airline\nWatch us shine, watch us shine\nWe're National, the Sunshine Airline\nWatch us shine, watch us shine\nWe're the Sunshine Airline\nWatch us shine\nEvery face is bright and friendly\nEvery job is done with pride\nNational means flying, on the sunny side\nWatch us shine\nWhen you want someone to help\nYou on your way\nFlying can be a pleasure\nNational proves it every day\nWatch us shine\nMaking time to do the special little things\nWe take a friendly smile and give it wings\nWe're National, the Sunshine Airline\nWatch us shine, watch us shine\nWe're the Sunshine Airline\nWatch us shine, watch us shine\nWatch us shine\nGiving people our special kind of care\nWe've got the best thing\nGoing in the air\nWatch us shine\nAs we show the world the best is not enough\nNo other airline out there has a.\nBetter team than us\nWe're National, the Sunshine Airline\nWatch us shine, watch us shine\nWe're the Sunshine Airline, watch us shine\nWe're National, the Sunshine Airline\nWatch us shine, watch us shine\nWe're the Sunshine Airline\nWatch us shine, watch us shine, watch us shine\nTMK(s) ® Registered • Marca(s) Registrada(s) RCA Corporation • Printed in US A\nSpecial Products\nDPL1-0278 STEREO"
